# W4 memory family waivers (rationale: docs/coverage/W4_MEMORY.md)
# MEMCH wrappers (20 protocols): structural constant bits
#   addr[16:14] / addr_full[16:14]  - ROWW=14 < AW=17, tied 0
#   dqs[1:0] (+ dqs port line)      - tied Hi-Z in educational MEMCORE
#   trace_cmd[2]                    - only codes 1..3 exist
#   haddr[8], trace_addr[8]         - NCH=1: sel must be 0 (BUG-MEMCH-1)
#   ca[7:6] (LPDDR6/7), ca[6] (LPDDR5/5X) - constant-0 CA padding
# DFI: init_cnt[7:5], lp_cnt[1], unused; dead default arms; if-attribution
# ONFI (LINE 123/138 -> 15w, TOGGLE 444/495 -> 51w; all structural):
#   line: 3 dead enum default arms (tstate/rstate/tfld) + 12 lines of the
#         RX CRC-verify/rx_done block mis-attributed by V5.006 coverage
#         (block provably executes: 96 shadow-matched echoes, rx_err set
#         by every injected CRC/STP/END error)
#   toggle: tmr[15:5], rtmr[15:5]  - baud counters only count 0..19
#           rstate[1]              - 2-state enum in logic[1:0]
#           tlen[5] (LEN<=16), tbit[5] (tbit<=31), ta_cnt[3] (=6),
#           ridx[5] (ridx<=22)     - counter high bits, constant 0
#           buf_mem[0]             - RX storage starts at index 1
#           buf_mem[22..23]        - array margin past max write index 21
